{
  "comment": "The golden set (export-spec §16). Each entry renders one project document at several canvas shapes, which is the point: the same project must compose correctly at 16:9, 9:16 and 1:1 from its per-aspect overrides (M30). Audio is the fixed synthetic track in spike/test-signal.ts, so the set needs no media asset in the repo. Regenerate with `npm run golden -- --update` on the RTX machine, and read the diff before committing it.",
